# Cloudflare Pages response headers (docs/architecture/launch.md, section 3.7.1).
# No CSP (decision 65) and no HSTS (*.pages.dev is HSTS-preloaded; turn it on for a custom domain in the dashboard).

# Every file here has a content hash in its name.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
